From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: nuubOS <nuubos@local>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 14:25:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] meson: resolve hwdata from cross sysroot

Buildroot installs hwdata.pc and pnp.ids in STAGING_DIR.  Do not force
Meson to resolve hwdata as a build-machine/native dependency.

---
 meson.build | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/meson.build b/meson.build
--- a/meson.build
+++ b/meson.build
@@ -18 +18 @@
-dep_hwdata = dependency('hwdata', required: false, native: true)
+dep_hwdata = dependency('hwdata', required: false)
-- 
2.51.0
